WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.508
Screenshare: your screen and conversation in one room.

00:00:03.508 --> 00:00:07.940
Enter your name. Leave the code empty to create a room.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:11.636
Copy the code so another person can join the same room.

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:15.598
Keep the conversation alongside the stream.

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:21.044
A real browser tab, streamed to the other peer over WebRTC.

00:00:21.044 --> 00:00:24.087
Focus the stream and keep the previews nearby.

00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:27.699
Choose a profile for your next share: games, video or code.

00:00:27.699 --> 00:00:31.199
Try screen-share.fly.dev/about. Browser, Windows and macOS.
